        "text_rB6U33": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Repairs and Our Partners</strong></p><p>Repairs are completed by our trusted repair partner, Cobblers Direct.<strong> </strong>The Hammitt Concierge team coordinates and oversees the repair process and will remain your primary point of contact. In some cases, Cobblers Direct may reach out directly if additional information is needed or if your<br/>request involves services that fall outside of warranty coverage and require payment.  </p><p>As part of our partnership, we are pleased to extend discounted pricing on select additional services, including bag cleaning. These additional services, such as cleaning, are optional and available at a discounted rate through our partnership with Cobblers Direct.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Repair Timeline</strong></p><p>Please allow 8-10 weeks from the time your bag is received for your repair to be completed and shipped back to you. Repair timelines may vary based on the nature of the repair, parts availability, and volume.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Preparing Your Bag for Shipment</strong></p><p>Please ship your bag without any additional items. <strong>Do not include dust bags, white boxes, or personal items</strong>, as we cannot guarantee that these items will be returned.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Shipping</strong></p><p>You are responsible for shipping your bag to us. A shipping label will be provided during the repair request process through our repairs portal. Once repairs are complete, we will ship your bag back to you at no additional cost.</p><p></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
